<request-parameters>
<!--
  D76 = "Underlying Cause of Death, 1999-2020". Run against live WONDER
  2026-09 — 19 ICD-10 chapters/year, 6-col `coded` contract as expected.

  Adapted from mortality_icd10.xml (the 113-list era) with two edits:
    B_2   D76.V4        -> D76.V2-level1  (group by ICD-10 CHAPTER, the
                          coarse ~17-chapter roll-up, not the 113 list)
    O_ucd D76.V4        -> D76.V2         (underlying-cause dimension = the
                          ICD-10 code hierarchy whose level-1 is Chapter —
                          the "button" that makes the Group By take, same
                          move provisional_causes.xml needed)
  Measures unchanged: M_1 Deaths, M_2 Population, M_3 Crude Rate, M_4 Age
  Adjusted Rate (D76 exposes AAR as an M_ measure — no O_aar_enable needed,
  unlike D176). {{YEAR_LIST}} -> F_D76.V1.

  Expected response cells (matches the `icd10` / `icd9` / `icd8` 6-col
  `coded` contract): year, chapter_code, chapter_label, deaths, population,
  crude_rate, age_adjusted_rate.

  Confirmed by the 2026-09 dump: D76 returns the chapter label with NO code
  range (the code is a separate `cd=` attribute), e.g.
  "Diseases of the circulatory system" — matches the CHAPTER_CANON keys in
  src/api/causesOfDeath.js directly.
-->
<parameter><name>accept_datause_restrictions</name><value>true</value></parameter>

<parameter><name>B_1</name><value>D76.V1-level1</value></parameter>
